    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;They fall from the skies. They are not just meteors. They are alive. And they want everything.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 <i>Commander Rhaegon Voss, BCF High Command</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Blackrock</i>, you are the last line of defense \u2014 a Commander of the <strong>Blackrock Containment Force (BCF)</strong>. Your mission: stop the spread of a sentient meteorite known only as <i>the Blackrock</i>, before it corrupts the planet entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped into hostile terrain with only a <strong>portal</strong>, a <strong>shard generator</strong>, and your <strong>launchpad</strong>, you\u2019ll need to summon and command units called <strong>Bravelings</strong> \u2014 autonomous fighters born to resist the Glimmergrubs, the grotesque minions spawned by the Blackrock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command the BCF</strong> \u2013 Step into the boots of a tactical Commander with real-time combat control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fend off Glimmergrubs</strong> \u2013 Face swarms of corrupted enemies that evolve and swarm relentlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon Bravelings</strong> \u2013 Use collected <strong>shards</strong> to deploy autonomous soldiers that fight by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Everything</strong> \u2013 Enhance your troops, defenses, generator, and your own combat skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Base Defense</strong> \u2013 Protect the generator, and outlast the corruption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Pixel Combat</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Shoot with precision in animated pixel style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy the Blackrock</strong> \u2013 The fight isn\u2019t over until the Blackrock is destroyed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blackrock</i> originally began as a small learning project to explore coding, game design, and the possibilities of GameMaker. Over time, it steadily grew into a larger experience \u2014 one that continues to evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a long-term passion project, developed and expanded step by step. <br>Development is ongoing, with regular updates, gameplay improvements, and new features planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your interest in <i>Blackrock</i>. The fight against corruption has only just begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Joe from\u00a0<i>Cavedwarf Studios</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;They fall from the skies. They are not just meteors. They are alive. And they want everything.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 <i>Commander Rhaegon Voss, BCF High Command</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Blackrock</i>, you are the last line of defense \u2014 a Commander of the <strong>Blackrock Containment Force (BCF)</strong>. Your mission: stop the spread of a sentient meteorite known only as <i>the Blackrock</i>, before it corrupts the planet entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped into hostile terrain with only a <strong>portal</strong>, a <strong>shard generator</strong>, and your <strong>launchpad</strong>, you\u2019ll need to summon and command units called <strong>Bravelings</strong> \u2014 autonomous fighters born to resist the Glimmergrubs, the grotesque minions spawned by the Blackrock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command the BCF</strong> \u2013 Step into the boots of a tactical Commander with real-time combat control.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fend off Glimmergrubs</strong> \u2013 Face swarms of corrupted enemies that evolve and swarm relentlessly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon Bravelings</strong> \u2013 Use collected <strong>shards</strong> to deploy autonomous soldiers that fight by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Everything</strong> \u2013 Enhance your troops, defenses, generator, and your own combat skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Base Defense</strong> \u2013 Protect the generator, and outlast the corruption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Pixel Combat</strong> \u2013\u00a0 Shoot with precision in animated pixel style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy the Blackrock</strong> \u2013 The fight isn\u2019t over until the Blackrock is destroyed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Blackrock</i> originally began as a small learning project to explore coding, game design, and the possibilities of GameMaker. Over time, it steadily grew into a larger experience \u2014 one that continues to evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a long-term passion project, developed and expanded step by step. <br>Development is ongoing, with regular updates, gameplay improvements, and new features planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for your interest in <i>Blackrock</i>. The fight against corruption has only just begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Joe from\u00a0<i>Cavedwarf Studios</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Command the BCF against sentient Blackrocks in this tactical top-down shooter base defense. Deploy Bravelings, fight Glimmergrubs, and destroy the Blackrock before it overwhelms everything.",
